---
// Features / Ethos section
---

<section class="w-full py-space-2xl bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-margin md:px-margin-md lg:px-margin-lg">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-space-2xl scroll-reveal">
      <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-on-tertiary-container font-semibold">The Mountains to Coast Travel Ethos</span>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary font-normal tracking-tight mt-space-xs">
        The Best Travel Guides for Mindful, Unhurried Discovery.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-space-sm">
        We reject the rushed tour bus model. Our Latin America guided tours honor the cadence of regional geography, led personally by experienced US travel guides for authentic, safe immersion.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-Column Feature Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-space-lg stagger-children">

      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-space-md">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">groups</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-caption text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">01 / Group Scale</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1 mb-space-sm">Small-Group &amp; Private</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Intimate expeditions capped strictly at 8 to 15 guests to ensure minimal ecological footprint and deep, quiet cultural immersion.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider">
          Guaranteed Ratios
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-space-md">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">school</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-caption text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">02 / Guidance</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1 mb-space-sm">Bilingual Naturalists</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Native guides formally accredited in tropical biology, volcanology, and regional ethnography for an authentic, scientific perspective.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider">
          GSTC Accredited
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-space-md">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">support_agent</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-caption text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">03 / Flexibility</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1 mb-space-sm">Transparent Booking</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Interest-free installment schedules, flexible seasonal date adjustments, and full dedicated concierge travel coordination from arrival to departure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider">
          Zero Hidden Fees
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4 -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-space-md">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">nest_eco_leaf</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-caption text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">04 / Regeneration</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1 mb-space-sm">100% Regenerative</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Every expedition directly funds indigenous land title trusts and biological corridor rewilding verified by Rainforest Alliance audits.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider">
          Verified 1% For Planet
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
